@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+[[esql-least]]
+=== `LEAST`
+
+Returns the minimum value from many columns. This is similar to <<esql-mv_min>>
+except it's intended to run on multiple columns at once.
+
+[source.merge.styled,esql]
+----
+include::{esql-specs}/math.csv-spec[tag=least]
+----
